## Acknowledgments

This project stands on the shoulders of many great open‑source libraries and tools. We are grateful to their authors and maintainers:

PySide6 — Official Qt bindings for Python (The Qt Company)
Official documentation: https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6
PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/PySide6/
Wiki: https://wiki.qt.io/Qt_for_Python

qt‑material — Material Design themes for Qt applications (Yasser A. Rebello / UN-GCPDS)
GitHub: https://github.com/UN-GCPDS/qt-material
Documentation: https://qt-material.readthedocs.io
PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/qt-material/

faster‑whisper — Optimized implementation of OpenAI's Whisper using CTranslate2 (Systran)
GitHub: https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/faster-whisper/

whisper — Speech recognition model (OpenAI)
GitHub: https://github.com/openai/whisper
PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/openai-whisper/

Piper TTS — Fast, local neural text-to-speech system (Rhasspy)
GitHub: https://github.com/rhasspy/piper
Samples: https://rhasspy.github.io/piper-samples/

Kokoro — Lightweight open‑weight TTS model (82M parameters) by hexgrad
Model (Hugging Face): https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
Official GitHub: https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro
PyPI (wrapper Python): https://pypi.org/project/kokoro/

Orpheus — SOTA open‑source TTS built on Llama‑3b (Canopy Labs)
GitHub: https://github.com/canopyai/Orpheus-TTS
Model (Hugging Face): https://huggingface.co/canopylabs/orpheus-3b-0.1-ft

LanguageTool — Open source grammar and style checker for 30+ languages ​​(LanguageTooler GmbH)
Official site: https://languagetool.org/
GitHub: https://github.com/languagetool-org/languagetool
Developers: https://languagetool.org/dev

Argos Translate — Open‑source offline neural machine translation (Argos Open Tech)
GitHub: https://github.com/argosopentech/argos-translate
Official site: https://www.argosopentech.com/
PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/argostranslate/

